{"seq":41,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2676"},"reason":"The body called the Deutsches Museum \"the single most visited museum in the country\"; it now says it topped the 2018 visitor figures (about 1.45 million across its sites, just ahead of Hamburg's Miniatur Wunderland), which is what the source shows.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Museen_in_Deutschland"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",280],["-","single"],["+","museum"],["=",1],["-","most"],["+","that"],["=",1],["-","visited"],["+","topped"],["=",1],["-","museum"],["+","the"],["=",1],["+","country's visitor figures "],["=",2],["-","the"],["+","2018"],["=",1],["-","country"],["+","–"],["=",1],["+","about 1.45 million across its sites, just ahead of Hamburg's Miniatur Wunderland – "],["=",295]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",254],["-","meistbesuchte "],["=",2],["-","des"],["+","mit"],["=",1],["-","Landes"],["+","den"],["=",1],["+","meisten Besuchen im Jahr 2018 – rund 1,45 Millionen an allen Standorten, knapp vor dem Hamburger Miniatur Wunderland – "],["=",283]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",264],["-","самый"],["+","музей,"],["=",1],["-","посещаемый"],["+","лидировавший"],["=",1],["-","музей"],["+","в"],["=",1],["-","страны"],["+","стране"],["=",1],["+","по числу посетителей в 2018 году (около 1,45 миллиона на всех площадках, чуть больше гамбургского «Миниатюр Вундерланда»), "],["=",279]]}],"hash":"549e65753f60","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"99e5e557dd0236c8c3777d9c97f30cc3ee15884f18cdf167e327c93e4611015d"},
