{"seq":46,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w14843"},"reason":"\"Germany's most visited museum\" is not a stable superlative: the Deutsches Museum led the 2018 figures only with its branch museums counted together (1,445,888), barely ahead of Miniatur Wunderland (1.4 million) and the Topographie des Terrors (1.38 million). The question now says \"one of Germany's most visited museums\" and adds the museum's own sourced claim to be the world's largest science and technology museum.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Museen_in_Deutschland"},{"url":"https://www.deutsches-museum.de/en/museum/about-us"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which Munich museum, founded in 1903 on the initiative of Oskar von Miller, is Germany's most visited museum?","new":"Which Munich museum, founded in 1903 on the initiative of Oskar von Miller, is one of Germany's most visited museums and the world's largest museum of science and technology?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welches Münchner Museum, 1903 auf Initiative Oskar von Millers gegründet, ist das meistbesuchte Museum Deutschlands?","new":"Welches Münchner Museum, 1903 auf Initiative Oskar von Millers gegründet, gehört zu den meistbesuchten Museen Deutschlands und ist das größte naturwissenschaftlich-technische Museum der Welt?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какой мюнхенский музей, основанный в 1903 году по инициативе Оскара фон Миллера, является самым посещаемым музеем Германии?","new":"Какой мюнхенский музей, основанный в 1903 году по инициативе Оскара фон Миллера, входит в число самых посещаемых музеев Германии и является крупнейшим в мире музеем естествознания и техники?"}],"hash":"ee303a9d0667","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"297326f2b85c33fed60de7efc6a911c05b13fa2f0d8686bb698d6376a1e0beed"},
